                <syl /><neume facs="#m-06be7f01-946b-43c2-a875-fd0818a17fb3" type="punctum" xml:id="m-b9efd876-0502-4fcd-8812-467cf32208b1">
                  <nc xml:id="m-c6119c45-be96-40d0-9b11-b517372c531f" pname="d" oct="3">
                    <signifLet xml:id="m-cf645687-fcb0-4ef7-9394-7c7deb505918" /></nc></neume></syllable><divLine xml:id="m-75bfbb81-a421-499b-8479-f39d1477959c" facs="#m-430ff99e-7001-4370-98c9-6500aa9fe754" form="finalis" /></layer></staff><div xml:id="m-1a2614ad-dbc3-4f20-9af2-a31184aa00ea"><lg xml:id="m-7afaf95f-0725-4494-97d8-b434f20038be"><l xml:id="m-78c627db-8b57-410d-99e7-db45ee6ce9fa" facs="#m-6a23245c-8174-4320-a8b7-5284f7fba5dd" label="ambiguous">1804</l><l xml:id="m-bb257650-8ee7-4fec-8b9d-ddbcc4fbf8f1" facs="#m-6c4d33dd-b2dd-419b-9fed-e2044cf3a02b" label="text-like">ofce for the Dead.</l><l xml:id="m-53e4b952-f4b8-44e2-bf13-8cf3cd89891c" facs="#m-019e6390-f75c-4d0c-91e5-723832c7df4f" label="ambiguous">Psalm 150.</l><l xml:id="m-8c672882-ff20-489b-afb6-e49db5880d49" facs="#m-820884d8-55b6-4b86-84f5-6c32ae3dd1b4" label="lyrics-like">1. Laudá-te Dóminum in sán-ctis é¬ jus:* laudá-te é-um</l><l xml:id="m-4194c2c4-aef6-4247-a8d9-f93876a2cd86" facs="#m-ff4e2c78-741f-451b-a37d-38347cfe8dc2" label="lyrics-like">in firmaménto virtú¬ tis é¬ jus.</l><l xml:id="m-bd1d71ff-b717-4b58-94aa-3055e3514102" facs="#m-8443ab9e-139b-4706-b58c-f90bb01c6e05" label="lyrics-like">Flex: bene-sonántibus:</l><l xml:id="m-661d06b7-0ec3-456e-91f7-d9b5768cf6e8" facs="#m-d5b6b75d-e718-4576-ad93-ac0c5984f2aa" label="lyrics-like">2. Laudáte éum in virtútibus éjus:* laudáte éum secúndum multitú¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a0e2a92-ac13-44b6-b10c-1c5a3eb33173" facs="#m-11bb5234-e220-41bb-a34a-b4eb17d4646e" label="lyrics-like">dinem magnitúdinis éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-cc974c76-c2f8-4b91-84ba-0f73009f8184" facs="#m-6848caf4-79f9-47f5-9055-a07b2fa31a2a" label="lyrics-like">3. Laudáte éum in sóno túbae:“laudáte éum in psaltério et cithara.</l><l xml:id="m-b80e7213-9ab3-42d5-823b-d01975d932c5" facs="#m-3448f33c-45f3-4f4f-8d33-e47385e282aa" label="lyrics-like">4. Laudáte éum in tympano et chóro:“laudáte éum in chórdis et</l><l xml:id="m-fe641dc7-92f4-4b59-8afa-f458d55278f8" facs="#m-34561b78-e959-408f-a462-046db755fd46" label="lyrics-like">órgano.</l><l xml:id="m-9e32179d-ed29-4225-9f79-d25341b12380" facs="#m-28882503-6a0d-4c70-affc-3df37473213f" label="lyrics-like">5. Laudáte éum in cymbalis benesonántibus : t laudáte éum in cym¬</l><l xml:id="m-ceb30e54-173f-4e28-8ccf-9f2220fad35a" facs="#m-a9dc7e10-6a8e-4eff-9ba9-d30a3f161499" label="lyrics-like">balis jubilatiónis :“omnis spiritus laudet Dóminum.</l><l xml:id="m-4fa175dc-d18c-43b5-88eb-c871ff108537" facs="#m-17a695c0-e8e3-4402-a5e2-ca634578cccb" label="lyrics-like">6. Réquiem aetérnam * dóna éis Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-b0b06769-de6e-4b10-b35c-88493bbda061" facs="#m-2c4f36fb-e64c-4f7f-b5a0-a09e5950e339" label="lyrics-like">7. Et lux perpétua “lúceat éis.</l><l xml:id="m-b70cbc3d-6770-4783-af80-c45a3fd88108" facs="#m-66ba3af6-4963-4343-96bc-e4db9bb00365" label="lyrics-like">V. Audí-vi vócem de caélo di-céntem mí-hi.</l><l xml:id="m-f8c1bd9b-1a20-41d5-b5d8-d3bfdc211a09" facs="#m-dc3d3299-1480-4825-8e18-0102478a9ea0" label="lyrics-like">N. Be-á-ti mórtu-i qui in Dómino mo-ri-úntur.</l><l xml:id="m-a4d562a9-163e-4736-8e86-465e633564c1" facs="#m-ca756a05-976d-427f-a81c-f57938bd021d" label="text-like">At Bened.</l><l xml:id="m-6efbfb41-ff59-40ce-b6d7-08430c41fb27" facs="#m-00d41883-2a0c-4254-92f0-7f57da89f37d" label="ambiguous">Ant. 2.D</l><l xml:id="m-75a59b24-b855-40d9-b8cd-2934b8eff930" facs="#m-f400b022-07b7-4c9d-a614-988f6b4362ce" label="lyrics-like">-go sum * re-surrécti-o et vi-ta: qui crédit in</l><l xml:id="m-62553498-3b84-46fd-a356-fdc1288d0bf0" facs="#m-0ce12fb7-3d70-4782-8f74-7103acba9578" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-41001723-af71-4995-942f-9a25eec24e0a" facs="#m-815b6af4-35d4-4e4a-9c9b-ee99487cf9a5" label="lyrics-like">me, ét-i-am si mórtu-us fú-e-rit, ví-vet: et ómnis qui</l><l xml:id="m-141f0490-c2e1-42e4-b131-acbe8cc2444d" facs="#m-7b5c4390-0b05-4197-9161-b4bcc37b3193" label="lyrics-like">ví-vit et crédit in me, non mo-ri-é-tur in aetérnum.</l></lg></div></section></score></mdiv></body></music>
</mei>